 but you  have to then go hire lawyers to enforce  it and say you're copying my patent and  you know  to do this so usually it's not worth it  for the entrepreneurs to have that kind  of expense to go and hire lawyers to do  it but you do have one year original  patent status for international coverage  but hopefully gives you some time to  figure out if your product is going to  sell or not and if it's worth taking  that next step so hopefully that helps  gives you some ideas to work with if you  guys liked the video please give it a  thumbs up below and I'd also love to  hear your thoughts and feedback if you  want to leave a comment and stay tuned  for the next episode  you
 

